{"text": "不知道毕业以后能干什么，感觉什么都做不好。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "每天加班到凌晨，可任务清单还是越变越长，我快喘不过气了。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "看着倒计时一点点走，我手心冒汗，注意力完全集中不了。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我每天都量好几次血压，明明正常还是忍不住担心。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "看到同龄人创业成功，自己还在打工，心里越来越焦虑。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "明天面试，我手心全是汗，脑子像浆糊一样。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "想报那个培训班，可是又怕花了钱坚持不下来。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "去食堂打饭，我故意绕开人多的地方走。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "他约我出去，我该穿那件黑的还是白的？真的好烦。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "看到别人升职加薪，而我还在原地踏步，心里特别不是滋味。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "这周三个项目撞在一起，我感觉自己随时会崩溃。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "明天要参加聚会，我完全不知道该怎么和人打招呼。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "孩子同学家长都在报各种班，我是不是耽误了自家孩子。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "同事比我晚入职却总被表扬，是不是我能力真的不行。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "工作三年了还是攒不下钱，以后的日子怎么过啊。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "每次开会想发言，话到嘴边又咽回去了。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "这次考试对我太重要了，我真的害怕失败。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "面试官问问题的时候，我连话都说不利索。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "明天就是deadline，我还有一个部分没完成，真的快疯了。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "白天总觉得自己哪里不舒服，上网查完更害怕了。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我明明已经很努力了，可为什么永远赶不上截止日期。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "进考场前腿都在发抖，深呼吸也压不住。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "站在超市货架前二十分钟了，还是不知道买哪个牌子的酱油。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "笔试时间快到了，我紧张得胃一直抽着疼。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "要不要和室友说换宿舍呢？我都纠结三天了还没开口。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "昨晚又失眠到凌晨四点，今天头昏脑涨，怕自己撑不住。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "走在路上总觉得别人在看我，浑身不自在。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "看到别人对答如流，我更觉得自己不行了。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "台下那么多人盯着我，我腿都在抖，好想逃。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "毕业论文题目换了好几次，现在连开题报告都不想写了。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我昨晚失眠到三点，满脑子都是万一考砸了怎么办。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "在电梯里遇到同事，我立刻低头假装看手机。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "睡前反复检查门窗和煤气，确认好几遍才能稍微安心。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "明天要汇报了，手心一直出汗，心慌得不行。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "同学聚会回来，发现大家都过得比我好，感觉自己一事无成。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "领导刚通知提前交报告，我手头还有一堆没改完，好焦虑。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "PPT还没讲完，我脑子突然空白了，卡住说不出话。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "一想到待会儿要发言，胃就揪着疼，想上厕所。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "每天醒来第一件事就是焦虑，不知道未来该怎么办。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "周末要不要回家？每次想订票都要想一整个下午。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "躺下两个小时了，脑子里全是乱七八糟的念头，就是睡不着。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "点了三遍外卖软件，最后还是什么都没点，算了不吃了。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "朋友圈里都在秀恩爱晒成就，只有我好像什么都做不好。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "别人健身三个月就有效果，我练了大半年还是老样子。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "看着身边的人都在往前走，只有我还停在原地。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "最近总是半夜惊醒，心跳快得厉害，感觉身体出了大问题。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "胸口偶尔刺痛一下，我就忍不住想是不是心脏出了问题。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "白天困得要命，晚上一躺下精神就来了，感觉自己快崩溃了。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我声音都在颤，感觉下一秒就要哭出来了，好丢人。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我才讲了两分钟，声音就开始发抖，控制不住。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我提前准备了好多遍，一上台全忘了，好崩溃。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "小组讨论时，我一句话都没说，怕说错。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "复习了好几遍，可一合上书就什么都想不起来了。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "周末全用来赶工了，到现在进度才一半，我好怕做不完。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "深呼吸好多次了，心脏还是跳得特别快，好紧张。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "投了十几份简历都没回音，是不是我真的很差。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "同事都下班了，就我一个人的工位还亮着灯，心里特别委屈。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "两个工作机会都不错，但我怕选错一个就毁了未来。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "我总担心自己选错了路，以后会后悔。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "感觉自己的努力没什么用，前途一片模糊。", "emotion": "sadness", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "电话响了，我盯着屏幕不敢接，心跳好快。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "爸妈对我期望那么高，我怕让他们失望。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "闺蜜比我小两岁已经买房了，我连首付都凑不够。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
{"text": "今天新来了一个同学，我不敢主动说话。", "emotion": "anxiety", "source": "synth_anxiety", "confidence": 1.0}
